[en.FOCUS_C02_APPLE_INSULT]
Responding to the Apple family

[en.FOCUS_C02_APPLE_INSULT_desc]
The second agricultural reform seriously damaged the interests of the Apple family, which also led to the tension in our diplomatic relations with Appleloosa. It is understood that they have terminated the trade agreement, protested against Trixie, and may even be secretly interfering in the elections in Ponyville. This is unacceptable.

[en.FOCUS_C02_APPLE_INSULT_OPINION_MODIFIER]
Tough Stance

[zh.FOCUS_C02_APPLE_INSULT]
回应苹果家族的挑衅

[zh.FOCUS_C02_APPLE_INSULT_desc]
第二次农业改革严重损害了苹果家族的利益，这也导致我们与苹果鲁萨的外交关系紧张。据了解，他们终止了贸易协定、抗议特丽克西、甚至可能在偷偷干预小马谷选举。这是不可接受的。

[zh.FOCUS_C02_APPLE_INSULT_OPINION_MODIFIER]
强硬立场

